          "title": "气测异常解释业务问题",
          "html": "<p>气测曲线受钻井液密度、脱气效率、接单根气影响大，峰值形态千变万化，人工解释一致性差；薄油气层常被背景气掩盖。</p><div class=\"figure\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 350\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"联合异常评分与阈值\"><g font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\" fill=\"#274746\"><path d=\"M112 258H670\" stroke=\"#d6e4e2\"/><text class=\"plot-y-tick\" x=\"100\" y=\"263\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"15\">-1.3</text><text class=\"plot-x-tick\" x=\"112\" y=\"282\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\">0.0</text><path d=\"M112 205.5H670\" stroke=\"#d6e4e2\"/><text class=\"plot-y-tick\" x=\"100\" y=\"210.5\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"15\">0.5</text><text class=\"plot-x-tick\" x=\"251.5\" y=\"282\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\">59.8</text><path d=\"M112 153H670\" stroke=\"#d6e4e2\"/><text class=\"plot-y-tick\" x=\"100\" y=\"158\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"15\">2.3</text><text class=\"plot-x-tick\" x=\"391\" y=\"282\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\">119.5</text><path d=\"M112 100.5H670\" stroke=\"#d6e4e2\"/><text class=\"plot-y-tick\" x=\"100\" y=\"105.5\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"15\">4.1</text><text class=\"plot-x-tick\" x=\"530.5\" y=\"282\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\">179.3</text><path d=\"M112 48H670\" stroke=\"#d6e4e2\"/><text class=\"plot-y-tick\" x=\"100\" y=\"53\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"15\">5.8</text><text class=\"plot-x-tick\" x=\"670\" y=\"282\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\">239.0</text><path d=\"M112.00 193.36 L114.33 157.83 L116.67 189.54 L119.00 194.95 L121.34 186.56 L123.67 193.24 L126.01 177.43 L128.34 186.45 L130.68 193.20 L133.01 179.31 L135.35 194.97 L137.68 193.50 L140.02 226.26 L142.35 196.47 L144.69 172.15 L147.02 185.37 L149.36 189.79 L151.69 207.01 L154.03 208.65 L156.36 189.93 L158.69 195.57 L161.03 231.36 L163.36 185.02 L165.70 206.42 L168.03 235.27 L170.37 196.61 L172.70 207.96 L175.04 224.32 L177.37 204.00 L179.71 234.18 L182.04 220.38 L184.38 221.17 L186.71 227.18 L189.05 232.06 L191.38 2