.59 111.19 L550.93 111.19 L553.26 111.19 L555.60 111.19 L557.93 111.19 L560.27 111.19 L562.60 111.19 L564.94 111.19 L567.27 111.19 L569.61 111.19 L571.94 111.19 L574.28 111.19 L576.61 111.19 L578.95 111.19 L581.28 111.19 L583.62 111.19 L585.95 111.19 L588.28 111.19 L590.62 111.19 L592.95 111.19 L595.29 111.19 L597.62 111.19 L599.96 111.19 L602.29 111.19 L604.63 111.19 L606.96 111.19 L609.30 111.19 L611.63 111.19 L613.97 111.19 L616.30 111.19 L618.64 111.19 L620.97 111.19 L623.31 111.19 L625.64 111.19 L627.97 111.19 L630.31 111.19 L632.64 111.19 L634.98 111.19 L637.31 111.19 L639.65 111.19 L641.98 111.19 L644.32 111.19 L646.65 111.19 L648.99 111.19 L651.32 111.19 L653.66 111.19 L655.99 111.19 L658.33 111.19 L660.66 111.19 L663.00 111.19 L665.33 111.19 L667.67 111.19 L670.00 111.19 \" stroke=\"#bd602b\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"272\" y=\"22\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#bd602b\">教学阈值</text><text class=\"plot-x-label\" x=\"391\" y=\"315\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"16\">时间 / min</text><text class=\"plot-y-label\" x=\"24\" y=\"153\" transform=\"rotate(-90 24 153)\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\">MAD标准化偏移</text></g></svg></div><div class=\"figcap\"><b>图 1</b><span>图为默认参数下实际生成的合成输入或预测关系；完整交互及误差由“案例演示”实时计算。</span></div>"
